# Campaign UI

- Read `DESIGN.md` then `CAMPAIGN-COPY.md`. Paint the copy; do not rewrite it.
- Do not touch `/`, `/about`, `/projects`.
- Default: **Pine + Punch (locked)**. Tune only if Sid unlocks it. Studio still shows the other two as rejects.
- Funky/artistic only inside a formal candidate poster (condensed name, vote chip, high contrast).
- No extra product features (forms, 100-day plans) unless the hub chat asks.
